gh to diagnose psoriasis. If in doubt, a skin biopsy can \nbe taken and sent for histopathology.  \n\u2022 Review medications and temporal history with commencement of medications and \npsoriasis. Many medications can trigger or exacerbate psoriasis, including lithium, beta-", "type": "Document"}}